<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-dorudon-atrox-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Dorudon atrox Turing wavelength at 253 µm, Priabonian 37.0 Ma (pass 2) — Code-to-model traceability: 84/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Docstring equations match steady_state, jacobian, diffusion_coefficients, and the chronoseries. The math-kg yaml points at those functions and at the Lean declarations. The vignette polynomial is a fit, not an equation in Turing 1952, and is labelled as such in fit_plate_critical_mode." ;
