    dct:description "Holding Du fixed, Dv/Du = 8, 11.657, 13.5, 15.970, 22, 32 moves lambda(k at sigma_max) through 215.4, 235.6, 243.2, 251.3, 269.3, 290.0 µm and sigma_max through -0.135, ~0, 0.045, 0.093, 0.174, 0.254. Both series are monotonic in the direction the dispersion relation predicts. a and b are not swept. The hindlimb mode count is a separate axis (8, 3, 0) and is drawn." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-parameter-expressivity> ;
